ost technologies, and uncover the truth behind humanity's downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171630/extras/e64513f3493043b436f683299ff827f0.poster.avif?t=1787668839\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171630/extras/e64513f3493043b436f683299ff827f0.webm?t=1787668839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171630/extras/e64513f3493043b436f683299ff827f0.mp4?t=1787668839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171630/extras/729d25efff3eadabb4300c04abe6f538.avif?t=1787668839\" width=586 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with just a pickaxe, but master lost technologies to create powerful machinery. Construct automated production and logistics systems to power the super drill and accelerate your surface return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171630/extras/0174c8ec0c3bfc14658a2e7e46c061a1.poster.avif?t=1787668839\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171630/extras/0174c8ec0c3bfc14658a2e7e46c061a1.webm?t=1787668839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171630/extras/0174c8ec0c3bfc14658a2e7e46c061a1.mp4?t=1787668839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span cla